description	"The Trandoshan

Based on Open Mode's Wookiee class, this version comes with a full arsenal of weapons and enhanced attributes. Note that all differences between the Wookiee and Trandoshan classes are purely cosmetic.

^2Weaponry:
- Claws
- Relby-v10 Targeting Rifle (3)
- Traditional Bowcaster (3)
- 3 Fragmentation Grenades

^8Attributes:
- Wookiee Strength (3)
- Heal (2)
- CTF: 37s Respawn

^2Strengths^7: Decent mix of explosives, ranged weaponry, and melee combined with knockback immunity and a large health pool.
^1Weaknesses^7: Vulnerable against Kill-bots and Droidekas.

Rawr!"